# Registered artifacts whose exact bytes are pinned by a test.
#
# tests/adaptive/test_dynamic_universe.py hashes this file in binary and
# compares the digest against a value recorded when the universe was
# registered. Without a rule here, git stores LF and checks out CRLF on
# Windows, so the same committed content hashes differently per platform:
# the test passed locally and failed on ubuntu-latest for a reason that
# had nothing to do with the artifact changing.
#
# Scoped to this one file on purpose. A repository-wide `text=auto` would
# renormalise unrelated files and bury that change in the diff.
config/capture_universe_v1.json text eol=lf
